        "Content": "•\tElegant End of Terrace 1920’s redbrick on Castle Avenue\r\n•\tOne of Clontarf’s most sought-after addresses \r\n•\t5 bed, 3 bath extending to approx. 210 sqm (excluding garage)\r\n•\tWesterly orientated 80-foot secluded rear garden  \r\n•\tGenerous plot with rear access from Victoria Road \r\n•\tWonderful scope to renovate and extend (SPP)\r\n•\tExcellent amenities and connectivity to Dublin City Centre (4.5kms)"
      },
